      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Steer/throttle/brake the real low-traction articulated rig; hold ACTION
    for its independent trailer brake. Drift Championship banks controlled lateral
    travel near the marked gates, then advances to the next gate. Precision Skating
    requires four genuine slow, aligned passages through gate centers; parking or
    circling inside a gate cannot score twice. Synchronized Jackknife pairs seats
    1+3 against 2+4, with AI filling unused seats: both trailers must actually drift
    with matched heading, articulation and speed. Frozen Freestyle banks sideways
    distance and completed half-turns only after recovering a controllable rig. Stopped
    jackknifes, unsupported trailers and lost hitches do not score.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
